{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disaster Blaster is a roguelite bullet heaven card game where you play a questionably sane scientist building the most over-the-top weapon in the universe. Evolve your blaster\u2019s card sequence and let it rip against hordes of alien enemies across a galaxy of unfortunate planets.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your blaster...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add and swap cards in your weapon as their effects are applied in sequence to the next shot.\u00a0Boost the damage, increase shooting speed,  turn bullets into incendiary and bouncing projectiles! Make incredible combos and watch your creation evolve and transform into an indomitable force!       <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/db-store-build.gif?t=1744813137\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">...Destroy everything else</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your weapon in a virtual conquest mission led by an alien who will face endless waves of enemies until the entire planet is destroyed. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/db-store-destroy.gif?t=1744813137\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover new planets and alien species</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new planets and face quirky native alien species, each with unique abilities. Unlock them as new characters you can use to test your weapons in future runs, harnessing their powers for even more dynamic gameplay.  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/db-store-discover.gif?t=1744813137\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock new cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock dozens of new cards for your weapon and combine them with alien abilities to maximize your offensive potential and create crazy synergies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/db-store-upgrade.gif?t=1744813137\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast-paced and varied</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy intense 10-minute matches with tons of customization possibilities. Each game is a different experience! </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First invasion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/26beeafbf17915559aaeada6cfbee95212e97947.jpg"},{"name":"I don't like cleaning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/c2441ee0fb0e5ad25d5c45f2bdd799798da06425.jpg"},{"name":"Rabbit hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/df1a23abdb47036131d019fb6c349e47f6b3fab5.jpg"},{"name":"Zzzzzzzzz","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/eba01e2ac472189a6ff73b8ef236bec35ee883e1.jpg"},{"name":"New dominators","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/5505c4b5c0e8327c1cb37a57a2c7a393423b7135.jpg"},{"name":"Angel or demon?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/845cae2a88f4bae0482cf1a8d1ff906420f0281b.jpg"},{"name":"Now you see me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/79149623ca3e846d8a225d3405c0c95221c473c5.jpg"},{"name":"Disaster Blaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/81805410e793351fe89a712dcb615303de0ab4fb.jpg"},{"name":"The ultimate scientist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/ec39f0be4e22156b8073490632366c2df8ede306.jpg"},{"name":"Catch 'em all","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194600/52e49329dafd461ef2c17a09e6b8b5066bb50