estroy.gif?t=1744813137\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover new planets and alien species</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new planets and face quirky native alien species, each with unique abilities. Unlock them as new characters you can use to test your weapons in future runs, harnessing their powers for even more dynamic gameplay.  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/db-store-discover.gif?t=1744813137\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock new cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock dozens of new cards for your weapon and combine them with alien abilities to maximize your offensive potential and create crazy synergies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/extras/db-store-upgrade.gif?t=1744813137\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast-paced and varied</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy intense 10-minute matches with tons of customization possibilities. Each game is a different experience! </p>","developers":["Jarsick"],"dlc":[3660070],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194600/header.jpg?t=1744813137","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098191,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098191/movie480.mp4?t=1743695706","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098191/movie_max.mp4?t=1743695706"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098191/f3dbe26a85a25e0ac5c86ccc2f7c80b59d58b4e3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743695706","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098191/mo